  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Generating PWA Icons**\n\nI\'m focusing on creating valid PNG PWA icons with a Python generator to avoid external dependencies. Right now, I\'m targeting `pwa-192x192.png`, `pwa-512x512.png`, `pwa-maskable-512x512.png`, and `apple-touch-icon.png`, ensuring they\'re correctly referenced in the manifest. The goal is a truly minimal, Python-native solution.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "KLUCa7iaBqv_vdIP0qXyuQ4"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_18218375024433394086"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"python3 -c \'\\nimport struct, zlib, math\\n\\ndef make_png(path, size, maskable=False):\\n    raw = bytearray()\\n    cx, cy = size / 2.0, size / 2.0\\n    scale = 0.68 if maskable else 0.85\\n    for y in range(size):\\n        raw.append(0)\\n        for x in range(size):\\n            t = (x + y) / (2.0 * size)\\n            r = int(11 * (1 - t) + 15 * t)\\n            g = int(37 * (1 - t) + 82 * t)\\n            b = int(64 * (1 - t) + 102 * t)\\n            nx = (x - cx) / (size * 0.5 * scale)\\n            ny = (y - cy) / (size * 0.5 * scale)\\n            # Medical cross in center\\n            if (abs(nx) < 0.14 and abs(ny) < 0.42) or (abs(ny) < 0.14 and abs(nx) < 0.42):\\n                r, g, b = 255, 255, 255\\n            else:\\n                # Teal protective ring around cross\\n                dist = math.hypot(nx, ny)\\n                if 0.62 < dist < 0.78:\\n                    r, g, b = 20, 184, 166\\n            raw.extend((r, g, b, 255))\\n    def chunk(tag, data):\\n        return struct.pack(\\\"!I\\\", len(data)) + tag + data + struct.pack(\\\"!I\\\", zlib.crc32(tag + data) & 0xffffffff)\\n    ihdr = struct.pack(\\\"!IIBBBBB\\\", size, size, 8, 6, 0, 0, 0)\\n    png = b\\\"\\\\x89PNG\\\\r\\\\n\\\\x1a\\\\n\\\" + chunk(b\\\"IHDR\\\", ihdr) + chunk(b\\\"IDAT\\\", zlib.compress(bytes(raw), 6)) + chunk(b\\\"IEND\\\", b\\\"\\\")\\n    with open(path, \\\"wb\\\") as f:\\n        f.write(png)\\n\\nmake_png(\\\"public/pwa-192x192.png\\\", 192, False)\\nmake_png(\\\"public/pwa-512x512.png\\\", 512, False)\\nmake_png(\\\"public/pwa-maskable-512x512.png\\\", 512, True)\\nmake_png(\\\"public/apple-touch-icon.png\\\", 180, False)\\nprint(\\\"Generated PNG icons successfully\\\")\\n\' && ls -lh public/*.png public/icon.svg\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":8000, \"toolAction\":\"Generating PWA PNG icons\", \"toolSummary\":\"Generate PWA PNG icons\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\350\004\n\345\004\001i\024}\023\353\220\023\336\257\353cG_\226I|nBK&\202\346\246\364\025\344\335\240\375\340\311\366\361\326}\037\333w13g\004p\203s\300@\251o!fLX\377r\327\264\271w\270\331\214.\322\315Q\023\361 \361\311r\004\312\222\3453G\221\240)\v\370\324\2250\0019r\267\031\337\022\360v\016\231\244R\373\b7\f>\343\v\201\201\207\311\254]@GX\243S6\255V\356X\210\nu\211\270r\036AS\005\223\204\230\207\374a\222\033F\030\"\';\363\230<X\265\227\246\332\034\364\210+\227\333jM\25131\264n\305>I\277[)\032hs\003\217\3013\204\037\234\000a\325\232\251\203\316\372\240n\371\231/\24125)\016>^\326r\025\372X\031H0\213\323\237s\2771)\341]\177N\\\271\321\214\036\236\vq\t\241\251\303\374\tc/\377\331\254\034\323\036\312\3212\002)\363\313\273G\306>\300\374\201O\245\317\004\204u\261\036\000\362e\312\327P\006qz\307)\302w\005\302\217Bp\036\212b\213F\300yb\311\006\006s]\306K^|:Q\\\351\"\330\271\036\277\275J\244-\337\364E\373\264\371\367\257\272 \301\341 \"\273\022\322\207\223\2345\345\330\350\307\234\2223\266\274\271\262\264\314\222[\216\026]\360\001\026\264\035\333}\200DN\304o#\336\325^\273\r\f(\246N6@u\246D\016\004S\213\252\273\246\257R\355\322<<\355\205\021\242\3763`0\314\032\371X\361\024MxO~\305\027\006\247Xq,\201\377h\313fS$\363\334\227\323xZwz\342\270\226\003DeL\2674\v\240\221\017\217\362\254\200\266\v\037\020\337\017h,f>\034\321\003L4\017[\306_\v2)XS8\254\026J\215\032\a# \271fR\300)\r\271$HI\350\224\305\261B\267\240e!\235\214at\273\235-8\226\212J\022\005\004\nG>\271\264\367\346\271\211!\251f\335\aP\206\'~F\370\306\'\321U\237\365?\216\363w\213\000\341\243\273V\214&\222\036\315\034j4\00287\226\307/o\255!\222>\233e\016\326\221L\277\242\277\211\224\004\216DM:\235\300\343\331\325.\352V\354h\005\205\223\337\217o\023%\f\353\031\003,\247\2414"
