  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Architecture**\n\nOkay, I\'m now meticulously designing a clean and modular architecture. I\'m focusing on creating a file structure where each layer is perfectly clean, modular, and type-safe. I\'ve begun mapping out the structure, keeping the shared domain types and bilingual i18n at the forefront of my mind.\n\n\n**Defining Domain Types**\n\nI\'ve completed defining all strongly-typed domain entities within `/src/types/domain.ts`, encompassing all 26 relational entities as requested. Also, bilingual i18n support is in place with `/src/i18n/translations.ts`, full English and Tamil UI dictionaries, and the Hindi architecture ready for translations.\n\n\n\n**Implementing Clinical Logic**\n\nNow I\'m diving into `/server/clinicalLogic.ts`. I\'m building a rule-based 9-input lifestyle risk score for Type 2 Diabetes, clearly labelled as experimental. I\'m also implementing a Clinical Testing Guideline Interpreter using ICMR/ADA thresholds. Finally, I\'m constructing a deterministic adaptive intervention ladder and a District Simulink Capacity Engine.\n\n\n**Adding the Server Backend**\n\nI\'m now implementing the server backend, focusing on the `/server.ts` file. I\'ve set up an Express server on port 3000, and integrated Vite for development and production. Strict input validation is handled by `zod`, along with token verification and backend RBAC middleware. I\'m building endpoints for authentication, bootstrap data, patient registration, lifestyle assessments, and prevention recommendations. I\'m also adding a CSV parser for Simulink models.\n\n\n**Building the API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now implementing the API endpoints, focusing on `/api/`. I\'m integrating endpoints for logging daily habits and updating prevention programs, and handling weekly lesson completion. I\'m also implementing endpoints for clinical data, with appropriate access control for doctors and admins. There will be retinal screening uploads and reviews with AI assistance, referral and appointment management, and follow-up tracking.\n\n\n**Developing Offline Features**\n\nI\'m now building out offline capabilities, specifically focusing on `/src/offline/`. I\'m using Dexie.js for a robust IndexedDB database, called `MritidhristiOfflineDB`. This database will store tables for patient data, assessments, habit logs, and pending actions, minimizing storage of protected health information. The sync engine will queue mutations like lifestyle assessments and habit logs, generating idempotency keys and batching requests to `/api/sync/batch`. It will also handle duplicate submissions, resolve version conflicts and preserves audit history.\nI\'m adding endpoints: `POST /api/notifications/:id/read`, `POST /api/sync/batch`, and admin endpoints for managing Simulink models. Also I\'m adding `GET /api/audit-logs` which demonstrates strict RBAC.\n\n\n**Enhancing Retinal Images**\n\nI\'m now implementing the 7-step retinal image processing pipeline within `/src/utils/retinalPipeline.ts`, working with both synthetic and user-uploaded images. This includes image quality assessment with ungradable rejection, enhancing and preprocessing with ROI masking, normalization, and contrast stretching. I\'m also adding PWA install hooks and a connectivity listener for real-time UI synchronization, and a switch to \"Simulate Offline Mode\" for testing.\n\n\n**Visualizing Diagnostic Outputs**\n\nI\'m now integrating overlays for retinal image analysis outputs. I\'ve added an anatomical structure overlay to highlight key features like the optic disc, retinal arcade vessels, and macula. Bright and dark lesion candidates are now clearly marked, but clearly labelled as illustrative/experimental. An ICDR grading interface is also being developed, including a confidence score, OOD checks, and a withholding gate, with output explicitly labeled as a screening prototype and *not* clinically validated. Finally, I\'m integrating a Grad-CAM explainability overlay, with interactive features and clear limitations.\n\n\n**Generating Screening Reports**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on the clinical screening reports. I\'m building a comprehensive report including patient information, quality metrics, and the model version. It will also have uncertainty status, human-review status, and options to export as JSON or a printable summary.\n\n**Building Frontend Views**\n\nNow I\'m developing modular frontend views. I am creating a deep navy-teal sidebar with role-aware navigation and a top bar with global search, connectivity controls, and language toggle. I\'m also building an interactive canvas for visualizing retinal images and a patient dashboard.\n\n\n**Constructing Dashboard Views**\n\nI\'m now building several key dashboard views. There is a doctor/healthcare worker dashboard, with a patient review queue and quick patient chart access. I\'m also creating an administrator dashboard, which provides an overview of district health metrics, with chart visualizations and data source labels. Finally, I\'m constructing a prevention module with registration, consent forms, and a lifestyle assessment, with interactive elements.\n\n\n**Implementing Clinical Pathways**\n\nI\'m now integrating clinical testing guidance, a 12-month prevention program with learning and maintenance phases, Indian food guidance, and habit tracking. I\'m developing the \"DetectModule,\" which includes a diabetic patient selector, retinal image upload with validation and presets, interactive pipeline inspection, an AI reliability panel, dataset integration, and an annotated report generator. I\'m also building the \"ProtectModule,\" which will feature a shared patient record and a doctor clinical review panel.\n\n\n**Integrating Clinical Management**\n\nI\'m now integrating clinical and patient management tools. I\'m focusing on `/src/views/`. I\'m developing Triage workflows, including protocols and notes, along with referral and appointment management. I\'m building a centralized reports hub for lab results and retinal screening reports. I\'m also adding a dedicated offline-first console, including live Service Worker and IndexedDB inspector. Additionally, I\'m building district resource planning and MATLAB support.\n\n\n**Simulating Analytics Scenarios**\n\nI\'m now implementing Simulink analytics with six distinct scenarios for comparison, using Recharts bar/line charts and KPI tables to visualize arrivals, wait times, and utilization. I\'ve built a real MATLAB Simulink CSV import parser, complete with a CSV template and scenario comparison. I\'m also adding a SettingsView with language preferences and authentication verification.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "SLUCa7DdNbT6xs0Ple-CyQg"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6733513006225152368"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type UserRole = \'patient\' | \'doctor\' | \'admin\';\\n\\nexport type LanguageCode = \'en\' | \'ta\' | \'hi\';\\n\\nexport type AppNavView =\\n  | \'dashboard\'\\n  | \'prevent\'\\n  | \'detect\'\\n  | \'protect\'\\n  | \'reports\'\\n  | \'appointments\'\\n  | \'referrals\'\\n  | \'notifications\'\\n  | \'offline\'\\n  | \'simulink\'\\n  | \'settings\';\\n\\nexport interface UserAccount {\\n  id: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  role: UserRole;\\n  title: string;\\n  facility?: string;\\n  patientId?: string;\\n  language: LanguageCode;\\n  isSynthetic: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ConsentRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  screeningConsent: boolean;\\n  dataStorageConsent: boolean;\\n  offlineCacheConsent: boolean;\\n  clinicalBoundaryAcknowledged: boolean;\\n  consentedAt: string;\\n  language: LanguageCode;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PatientRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  mrn: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  age: number;\\n  sex: \'Female\' | \'Male\' | \'Other\';\\n  phone: string;\\n  district: string;\\n  villageOrWard: string;\\n  language: LanguageCode;\\n  diabetesStatus: \'at_risk\' | \'prediabetes_lab\' | \'diagnosed_t2d\';\\n  assignedHealthWorker: string;\\n  assignedDoctorId: string;\\n  registeredAt: string;\\n  consent: ConsentRecord;\\n  isSynthetic: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LifestyleInput {\\n  age: number;\\n  dietQuality: \'balanced_traditional\' | \'moderate_refined\' | \'high_refined_sugars\';\\n  sleepHours: number;\\n  dailySteps: number;\\n  weightKg: number;\\n  heightCm: number;\\n  waistCm: number;\\n  familyHistory: \'none\' | \'one_parent\' | \'both_parents_or_sibling\';\\n  smokingStatus: \'never\' | \'former\' | \'current\';\\n  alcoholUse: \'none\' | \'occasional\' | \'regular\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RiskFactorContribution {\\n  factor: string;\\n  points: number;\\n  maxPoints: number;\\n  modifiable: boolean;\\n  summary: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LifestyleAssessment {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  assessedAt: string;\\n  inputs: LifestyleInput;\\n  experimentalScore: number; // 0-100 rule-based experimental score\\n  riskCategory: \'Low\' | \'Moderate\' | \'Elevated\';\\n  scoringModelLabel: string;\\n  contributions: RiskFactorContribution[];\\n  topModifiableFactors: string[];\\n  explanation: string;\\n  recommendations: string[];\\n  recordedOffline: boolean;\\n  syncStatus: \'synced\' | \'pending\';\\n  idempotencyKey?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LabResult {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  recordedByDoctorId: string;\\n  recordedByName: string;\\n  testedAt: string;\\n  hba1cPercent?: number;\\n  fastingGlucoseMgDl?: number;\\n  guidelineInterpretation: string;\\n  clinicalNotes: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WeeklyLesson {\\n  id: string;\\n  week: number;\\n  phase: 1 | 2;\\n  title: string;\\n  titleTa: string;\\n  category: \'Indian Nutrition\' | \'Physical Activity\' | \'Sleep & Stress\' | \'Monitoring\';\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  summary: string;\\n  completed: boolean;\\n  completedAt?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface HabitLog {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  date: string;\\n  healthyIndianDiet: boolean;\\n  stepsAchieved: number;\\n  sleepHours: number;\\n  weightKg?: number;\\n  waistCm?: number;\\n  barrierReported?: string;\\n  recordedOffline: boolean;\\n  syncStatus: \'synced\' | \'pending\';\\n  idempotencyKey?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface InterventionRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  triggeredAt: string;\\n  triggerRule: string;\\n  ladderStep: 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5;\\n  actionType: \'barrier_check\' | \'simpler_activity\' | \'reminder_adjust\' | \'coach_escalation\' | \'clinician_escalation\';\\n  recommendedMessage: string;\\n  experimentalBanditArm?: string;\\n  status: \'active\' | \'resolved\' | \'escalated\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PreventionProgramme {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  startedAt: string;\\n  currentMonth: number; // 1-12\\n  phase: \'PHASE 1: LEARNING (Months 1-6)\' | \'PHASE 2: MAINTENANCE (Months 7-12)\';\\n  adherencePercent: number;\\n  baselineWeightKg: number;\\n  currentWeightKg: number;\\n  baselineWaistCm: number;\\n  currentWaistCm: number;\\n  checkpoints: {\\n    day: 30 | 60 | 90 | 180 | 365;\\n    label: string;\\n    status: \'completed\' | \'upcoming\' | \'due\';\\n    notes: string;\\n  }[];\\n  lessons: WeeklyLesson[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ImageQualityAssessment {\\n  sharpnessScore: number; // 0-100\\n  brightnessMean: number; // 0-255\\n  exposureClipPercent: number; // 0-100\\n  width: number;\\n  height: number;\\n  gradable: boolean;\\n  rejectionReason?: string;\\n  recaptureGuidance?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type ICDRGrade = 0 | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | null;\\n\\nexport interface RetinalScreening {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  capturedAt: string;\\n  eye: \'Left (OS)\' | \'Right (OD)\';\\n  cameraSource: string;\\n  imagePreset: \'normal_demo\' | \'moderate_npdr_demo\' | \'ungradable_blur_demo\' | \'uploaded_custom\';\\n  imageDataUrl?: string;\\n  quality: ImageQualityAssessment;\\n  anatomicalStructures: {\\n    opticDiscDetected: boolean;\\n    vesselDensityIndex: number;\\n    maculaCentered: boolean;\\n  };\\n  lesionFindings: {\\n    hardExudatesFlag: boolean;\\n    haemorrhagesFlag: boolean;\\n    microaneurysmsExperimentalNote: string;\\n    implementationStatus: \'Illustrative / Prototype Heuristic\';\\n  };\\n  modelPrediction: {\\n    modelVersion: string;\\n    architectureReference: string;\\n    icdrGrade: ICDRGrade;\\n    gradeLabel: string;\\n    confidence: number; // 0-1\\n    uncertainty: number; // 0-1\\n    oodFlag: boolean;\\n    gradeWithheld: boolean;\\n    withholdReason?: string;\\n    isIllustrativeOutput: boolean;\\n  };\\n  gradCam: {\\n    available: boolean;\\n    hotspots: { x: number; y: number; radius: number; intensity: number }[];\\n    limitationNotice: string;\\n  };\\n  humanReviewStatus: \'pending_review\' | \'confirmed\' | \'rejected_modified\' | \'recapture_requested\';\\n  summaryText: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DoctorReview {\\n  id: string;\\n  screeningId: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  doctorId: string;\\n  doctorName: string;\\n  reviewedAt: string;\\n  decision: \'confirmed\' | \'rejected_modified\' | \'recapture_requested\';\\n  clinicianGrade: string;\\n  triageCategory: \'Routine (12 months)\' | \'Priority (3-6 months)\' | \'Urgent Ophthalmology (< 2 weeks)\' | \'Immediate Recapture\';\\n  clinicalNotes: string;\\n  recommendedNextSteps: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReferralRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  screeningId?: string;\\n  createdByDoctorId: string;\\n  createdByDoctorName: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  targetFacility: string;\\n  specialty: \'Ophthalmology\' | \'Diabetology\' | \'Primary Health Centre\';\\n  urgency: \'Routine\' | \'Priority\' | \'Urgent\';\\n  reason: string;\\n  status: \'Pending\' | \'Accepted\' | \'Completed\' | \'Cancelled\';\\n  specialistFindings?: string;\\n  completedAt?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AppointmentRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  facility: string;\\n  clinicianName: string;\\n  scheduledDate: string;\\n  scheduledTime: string;\\n  type: \'Follow-up Consultation\' | \'Retinal Screening\' | \'Ophthalmology Referral\' | \'Lab Testing (HbA1c/FPG)\';\\n  status: \'Confirmed\' | \'Pending Confirmation\' | \'Attended\' | \'Missed\' | \'Cancelled\';\\n  reminderNote: string;\\n  escalated?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FollowUpRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  patientId: string;\\n  healthWorkerName: string;\\n  dueDate: string;\\n  channel: \'In-Person PHC\' | \'Phone Call\' | \'Home Visit\';\\n  status: \'Scheduled\' | \'Completed\' | \'Escalated\';\\n  outcomeNotes: string;\\n  nextScreeningDate?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface NotificationItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  roleTargets: UserRole[];\\n  patientId?: string;\\n  severity: \'info\' | \'warning\' | \'urgent\' | \'success\';\\n  title: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  read: boolean;\\n  actionView?: AppNavView;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AuditLogEntry {\\n  id: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  userName: string;\\n  role: UserRole;\\n  action: string;\\n  resourceType: string;\\n  resourceId: string;\\n  outcome: \'SUCCESS\' | \'DENIED\' | \'CONFLICT\';\\n  details: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DistrictResourceMetric {\\n  id: string;\\n  facilityName: string;\\n  type: \'PHC\' | \'District Hospital\' | \'Mobile Screening Unit\';\\n  fundusCameras: number;\\n  ophthalmologists: number;\\n  healthWorkers: number;\\n  dailyCapacity: number;\\n  currentUtilizationPct: number;\\n  connectivityProfile: \'Stable Broadband\' | \'Intermittent 4G\' | \'Offline-First Rural\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SimulinkScenarioResult {\\n  id: string;\\n  scenarioKey:\\n    | \'normal\'\\n    | \'high_volume\'\\n    | \'limited_connectivity\'\\n    | \'camera_shortage\'\\n    | \'ophthalmologist_shortage\'\\n    | \'increased_referral\';\\n  name: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  source: \'Illustrative Analytical Simulation (Not MATLAB Execution)\' | \'Imported MATLAB Simulink CSV\';\\n  dailyPatientArrivals: number;\\n  camerasAvailable: number;\\n  screeningCapacityPerDay: number;\\n  imageThroughputPerHour: number;\\n  ophthalmologistsAvailable: number;\\n  healthWorkerWorkloadPct: number;\\n  referralDemandPerWeek: number;\\n  avgQueueLength: number;\\n  avgWaitTimeMinutes: number;\\n  resourceUtilizationPct: number;\\n  estimatedMonthlyCostInr: number;\\n  bottleneck: string;\\n  hourlyQueueCurve: { hour: string; queueLength: number; waitMinutes: number }[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface BootstrapPayload {\\n  user: UserAccount;\\n  patients: PatientRecord[];\\n  assessments: LifestyleAssessment[];\\n  labs: LabResult[];\\n  programmes: PreventionProgramme[];\\n  habitLogs: HabitLog[];\\n  interventions: InterventionRecord[];\\n  screenings: RetinalScreening[];\\n  doctorReviews: DoctorReview[];\\n  referrals: ReferralRecord[];\\n  appointments: AppointmentRecord[];\\n  followUps: FollowUpRecord[];\\n  notifications: NotificationItem[];\\n  districtResources: DistrictResourceMetric[];\\n  simulations: SimulinkScenarioResult[];\\n  auditLogs: AuditLogEntry[];\\n  meta: {\\n    dataProvenance: \'Synthetic Prototype Dataset + Live Session Mutations\';\\n    clinicalDisclaimer: string;\\n    serverTime: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Define comprehensive TypeScript domain models covering all 26 relational entities across Prevent, Detect, Protect, Offline Sync, Audit, and Simulink modules\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/domain.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating shared domain types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/types/domain.ts\"}"
