  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The App**\n\nI\'m now building the root application shell, `/src/App.tsx`. This is the core structure. It will integrate a server-verified, in-memory `Authorization: Bearer <token>` session. A synthetic patient demo session starts automatically, allowing the dashboard to render cleanly at the initial load. It also enables full role-switching functionality.\n\n\n**Implementing Offline Support**\n\nI\'m making progress on offline capabilities. I\'ve integrated a `navigator.onLine` listener and an offline test mode. Dexie.js IndexedDB caching is implemented for patient workflow summaries, along with an offline action queue. The system will automatically sync when connectivity returns. Moreover, the project\'s progress is tracked in `/PROJECT_PROGRESS.md`.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "i8YCa4zxH8WU_uMP5taewAo"
